{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_fd3ee589bc614e04bec205ea79d4d870","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"3:39\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3690\">\n    <frame id=\"3:40\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\">\n      <text id=\"3:41\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"3:42\" name=\"Investment Wallet — crypto wallet for beginners\" x=\"0\" y=\"32\" width=\"1312\" height=\"54\" />\n      <text id=\"3:43\" name=\"Design the Investment Wallet mobile app for a beginner investor: see the wallet balance, assets and savings pockets, discover investing strategies and coins, read about the “Aggressive Growth” strategy, invest 3,021 DAI in it and confirm the result. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"98\" width=\"1312\" height=\"78\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:44\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"288\" width=\"1312\" height=\"259\">\n      <text id=\"3:45\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:46\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 5 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, gain / loss, risk levels, success / disabled, accents and chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the page indicator, the sheets and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the coin logos, neutral avatar and icons from 04 · Media. Emoji in the copy are plain text characters. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"207\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:47\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"595\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1294\">\n      <text id=\"3:48\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:49\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:50\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1203\">\n        <frame id=\"3:51\" name=\"01_Wallet\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"371\">\n          <text id=\"3:52\" name=\"01_Wallet\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"86\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:53\" name=\"Goal: See total balance, assets and savings pockets.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:54\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:55\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_Neutral · “My Wallet” · address 0xc8...320f · scan entry • Actions: Send · Receive • Assets: “Assets” · Ethereum / Dai / Avalanche / PancakeSwap, each with logo, name, holding, value and 24h change • Balance: $54,292.79 · +5.21% • Main navigation: page 2 of 3 (My Wallet) • Pockets: “Pockets” · My New House 🏡 · Tesla Model S Plaid 🚙, each with value, name and change · Add Pocket\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"168\" />\n          <text id=\"3:56\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"298\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:57\" name=\"→ swipe / page indicator → 02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"325\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:58\" name=\"02_Discovery\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"413\">\n          <text id=\"3:59\" name=\"02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"121\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:60\" name=\"Goal: Discover strategies and coins worth investing in.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:61\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:62\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_Neutral · search entry • Coin list: “Coin Lists” · 10 coins, each with logo, name, ticker, price and 24h change • Coin list tabs: 🔥 Trending / 📺 Watchlist / ❤️ Favorites / 💵 Stablecoins / 🔗 BNB Chain Ecosystem · current: Trending • For you: “December 05” · “For You Today” · Stable Income · Binance Index Strategy, each with risk, participants, yearly return and View • Main navigation: page 3 of 3 (Discovery) • Strategies: “Investing Strategies” · The Big Long · Aggressive Growth · Best Projects · Strategy 2022, each with yearly return, 3 asset logos and “+N” more\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"189\" />\n          <text id=\"3:63\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"319\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:64\" name=\"→ Aggressive Growth → 03_Strategy → swipe / page indicator → 01_Wallet\" x=\"25\" y=\"346\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:65\" name=\"03_Strategy\" x=\"0\" y=\"437\" width=\"644\" height=\"413\">\n          <text id=\"3:66\" name=\"03_Strategy\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"109\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:67\" name=\"Goal: Understand the Aggressive Growth strategy before investing.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:68\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:69\" name=\"• About: “About Strategy” · description (see DATA) • Actions: Invest · dismiss • Facts: 159% per Year · Interest Income / High Risk · Level of risk / $1,000 · Minimum investment amount / 2 Years · Recommended investment period / 1,982 · Participants • Presentation: sheet over 02_Discovery • Projection: $1,590.00 · “This is how much you can earn in a year if you invest $1,000 to “Aggressive Growth”” · growth chart Dec ’21 – Dec · risk “🔥 High Risk” • Share of assets: “Share of Assets” · 5 assets, each with logo, name, ticker and share (see DATA)\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"189\" />\n          <text id=\"3:70\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"319\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:71\" name=\"→ Invest → 04_Invest_Amount → dismiss → 02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"346\" width=\"594\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:72\" name=\"04_Invest_Amount\" x=\"668\" y=\"437\" width=\"644\" height=\"350\">\n          <text id=\"3:73\" name=\"04_Invest_Amount\" x=\"25\" y=\"25\" width=\"167\" height=\"27\" />\n          <text id=\"3:74\" name=\"Goal: Enter how much DAI to invest.\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\" width=\"594\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:75\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"25\" y=\"93\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:76\" name=\"• Actions: back · Max · swap input currency · Hold to Invest (Icon_Face_ID) • Amount: DAI (Coin_DAI) · 3,021 being entered • Copy: “Invest to Strategy” · “⛽️ No gas, free investments” • Keypad: 1 · 2 ABC · 3 DEF · 4 GHI · 5 JKL · 6 MNO · 7 PQRS · 8 TUV · 9 WXYZ · “,” · 0 · backspace • Presentation: sheet over 02_Discovery\" x=\"25\" y=\"120\" width=\"594\" height=\"126\" />\n          <text id=\"3:77\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"25\" y=\"256\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"3:78\" name=\"→ back → 