 For You cards, other strategies, coins, coin-list tabs other than Trending, Max, swap currency.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"115\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:89\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"2152\" width=\"1312\" height=\"806\">\n      <text id=\"3:90\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:91\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. Today is December 05. Prices in USD.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:92\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"715\">\n        <frame id=\"3:93\" name=\"Wallet\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"109\">\n          <text id=\"3:94\" name=\"Wallet\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"44\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:95\" name=\"“My Wallet” · 0xc8...320f · $54,292.79 · +5.21% = assets $10,261.18 + pockets $44,031.61\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:96\" name=\"Assets (holding · value · 24h)\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"3:97\" name=\"Assets (holding · value · 24h)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"199\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:98\" name=\"Ethereum · 2.569032 ETH · $3,226.31 · +3.48% (Coin_ETH) Dai · 3,045.86 DAI · $3,021.15 · −0.02% (Coin_DAI) Avalanche · 180.02 AVAX · $2,440.09 · +1.54% (Coin_AVAX) PancakeSwap · 397.33 CAKE · $1,573.63 · −0.02% (Coin_CAKE)\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:99\" name=\"Pockets\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"129\">\n          <text id=\"3:100\" name=\"Pockets\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"56\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:101\" name=\"My New House 🏡 · $15,642.40 · +7.86% Tesla Model S Plaid 🚙 · $28,389.21 · −2.13% Add Pocket\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:102\" name=\"For You Today\" x=\"0\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"149\">\n          <text id=\"3:103\" name=\"For You Today\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"97\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:104\" name=\"Stable Income · Low risk · 10,982 participants · 6.24% per year · View Binance Index Strategy · Medium risk · 264 participants · 12.56% per year · View\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"80\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:105\" name=\"Investing Strategies (per year · logos · more)\" x=\"444\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"149\">\n          <text id=\"3:106\" name=\"Investing Strategies (per year · logos · more)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"303\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:107\" name=\"The Big Long · 15.16% · BTC, ETH, USDT · +3 Aggressive Growth · 159% · MATIC, MANA, CAKE · +2 Best Projects · 46.22% · NEAR, DASH, AVAX · +12 Strategy 2022 · 26.08% · ETC, DAI, BNB · +2\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"80\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:108\" name=\"Coin Lists · 🔥 Trending (price · 24h)\" x=\"888\" y=\"193\" width=\"420\" height=\"269\">\n          <text id=\"3:109\" name=\"Coin Lists · 🔥 Trending (price · 24h)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"245\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:110\" name=\"Bitcoin BTC $16,963.58 · −0.12% Ethereum ETH $1,259.10 · +1.15% Tether USDT $1.01 · +0.01% Binance Coin BNB $288.01 · +0.76% USD Coin USDC $0.9999 · −0.02% Binance USD BUSD $1.00 · −0.01% XRP XRP $0.3891 · +2.54% Dogecoin DOGE $0.1012 · −0.17% Cardano ADA $0.3196 · +0.09% Polygon MATIC $0.9082 · +2.18%\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"200\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:111\" name=\"Aggressive Growth\" x=\"0\" y=\"486\" width=\"420\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"3:112\" name=\"Aggressive Growth\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"132\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:113\" name=\"Projection: $1,590.00 earned in a year on $1,000 Chart labels: Dec ’21 · Mar · Jun · Sep · Dec “The aggressive growth strategy allows you to earn 159% per annum, but with a high risk. Our analysts have balanced the strategy with different assets so that the strategy pays off within the recommended time frame.” Facts (with emoji): 🌱 159% per Year · 🔥 High Risk · 💵 $1,000 minimum · 🗓️ 2 Years · 🧑 1,982 participants\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:114\" name=\"Share of Assets\" x=\"444\" y=\"486\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"3:115\" name=\"Share of Assets\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"108\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:116\" name=\"Polygon (MATIC) 50.00% Decentraland (MANA) 25.00% PancakeSwap (CAKE) 12.50% Dogecoin (DOGE) 6.25% Maker (MKR) 6.25%\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:117\" name=\"Invest &amp; success\" x=\"888\" y=\"486\" width=\"420\" height=\"169\">\n          <text id=\"3:118\" name=\"Invest &amp; success\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"115\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"3:119\" name=\"Amount 3,021 DAI (balance 3,045.86 DAI; minimum $1,000 met) Button “Hold to Invest” Success: “You’ve invested!” · 3,021.00 DAI · button “View Pocket”\" x=\"20\" y=\"49\" width=\"380\" height=\"100\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:120\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"3006\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"3:121\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"36\" />\n      <frame id=\"3:122\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"229\">\n        <frame id=\"3:123\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"3:124\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"3:125\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color #2B2D33 + Nunito • Media: coin logos, neutral avatar, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"596\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"3:126\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"3:127\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"3:128\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, gain / loss, risk levels, accents, chart colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: current page, selected tab, pressed, disabled, amount being entered, rising / falling • Headers, page indicator, sheets and all business components • Chart and share-of-assets styling, confetti\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"596\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"3:129\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"3335\" width=\"1312\" height=\"291\">\n      <text id=\"3:130\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"3:131\" name=\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n      <text id=\"3:132\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current page, current coin-list tab, gains vs losses, risk levels, amount being entered)\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1312\" height=\"161\" />\n      <text id=\"3:133\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 5 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"268\" width=\"1312\" height=\"23\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"97702975-d088-43db-ac65-9a918433e3fa"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_fd3ee589bc614e04bec205ea79d4d870","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
